      "text": "Round the numerator and denominator: \\(\\frac{401}{0.205} \\approx \\frac{400}{0.2}.\\)\n\nSince \\(\\frac{400}{0.2} = 2000,\\) the value is closest to \\(2000.\\)\n\nThus, the correct answer is E .",
